    doc:inSection ex:fort-a-federated-ontology-and-timeseries-query-engine-section-12 ;
    doc:pageNumber 4 ;
    doc:paragraphOrder 2 ;
    doc:text "endpoints with a triple store. In addition, FOrT´E exposes the timeseries stores as a SPARQL endpoint for applications. The engine’s execution plan looks up for the ﬁltering and joins operations in the federated SPARQL query, such as line 25 of Listing 1, and rewrites optimized queries." ;
